trie-autocomplete

src/lib/data/next-words.txt is derived from the English sentences of
Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), a collection of sentences and translations
contributed by its members. Tatoeba's sentences are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France licence (CC BY 2.0 FR):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/

The file lists, for 500 common words, the words that most often follow
them in those sentences. It was made by counting pairs of words in the
export at https://downloads.tatoeba.org/exports/per_language/eng/eng_sentences.tsv.bz2
with scripts/build-next-words.mjs; no sentences are included.
